---
title: Skillet Cabbage
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Veggies
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@salad oil{1%Tbsp}
@chopped celery{1%c}
@chopped green pepper{1%small}
@pepper{1%dash}
@shredded cabbage{3%c}
@chopped onion{1%small}
@salt{1/2%tsp}

20 minutes before serving, put all ingredients in a pan and stir until mixed. Cover pan and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally. Serve immediately.
